#   MC "Oh, yeah, I almost forgot."
    MC "Ah, sim, quase me esqueci."

# game/script.rpy:7837
translate brazil V11Act52_1f3c893b:

#   MC "Guess where we’re going in 3 days."
    MC "Adivinha para onde vamos daqui a 3 dias."

